---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="relative py-32 bg-white overflow-hidden border-t-4 border-black retro-grid">

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      
      <!-- Typography / Content Side -->
      <div class="space-y-10" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-black"></div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-black/50 font-pixel">Biz Kimiz?</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none">
          NEDEN <br/>
          <span class="text-purple-600 mt-2 block">BİZİMLE</span>
          ÇALIŞMALISINIZ?
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-black/85 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Evolution Büyüme Tüneli olarak amacımız sadece estetik web siteleri yapmak değil. İşletmenizin telefonunu çaldıracak ve her gün yeni müşteri talebi toplayacak yüksek performanslı sistemler kuruyoruz.
          </p>
          <p>
            Rakipleriniz dijital reklam bütçelerini hedefsizce harcarken, biz bütçenizi en verimli şekilde kullanarak doğrudan yüksek bütçeli ve satın almaya hazır kitlelere ulaşmanızı sağlıyoruz.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <a href="#iletisim" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-black border-b-2 border-black pb-2 hover:border-blue-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors font-pixel">
            ÜCRETSİZ ANALİZ İSTEYİN
            <Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" size={20} class="group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual / Abstract Side -->
      <div class="relative h-[450px] rounded-none bg-slate-50 border-4 border-black overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]" data-aos="fade-left">
        
        <!-- Stats Grid Overlay -->
        <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-0.5 bg-black p-0.5 rounded-none">
          
          <div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-none hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-black mb-2 font-pixel">5+</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 font-pixel">YILLIK TECRÜBE</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-none hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-black mb-2 font-pixel">ADS</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 font-pixel">GOOGLE & META</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-none hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#25D366] mb-2 font-pixel">%100</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 font-pixel">PERFORMANS</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-none hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2 font-pixel">1-1</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 font-pixel">BİREBİR DESTEK</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>